ex:C027P0014 a ct:SourcePassage ;
    ct:end_char 2404 ;
    ct:exact_text "terminated Service shall cease to accrue on and after the effective date of such termination. In the event that Diplomat terminates this Agreement other than in accordance with Section 3, Diplomat shall be obligated to pay for the Services in accordance with the fee schedule contained on EXHIBIT A throughout the balance of the Period (as hereinafter defined) as though Tadeo continued to provide the terminated Services through the balance of the Period. Late payments shall accrue interest at a rate equal to fifteen (15%) percent per annum." ;
    ct:source_path "cuad/DYNTEKINC_07_30_1999-EX-10-ONLINE HOSTING AGREEMENT.txt" ;
    ct:source_sha256 "75cb8dce69c94723ec13f9414fc50d7712a20574ea077674d359447edb709a14" ;
    ct:start_char 1860 .

ex:C027P0016 a ct:SourcePassage ;
    ct:end_char 2666 ;
    ct:exact_text "(a) The term of this Agreement shall begin on the date hereof (the \"Effective Date\") and shall continue for a period of 12 months thereafter (the \"Period\") in full force and effect until it is terminated in accordance with this Section 3." ;
    ct:source_path "cuad/DYNTEKINC_07_30_1999-EX-10-ONLINE HOSTING AGREEMENT.txt" ;
    ct:source_sha256 "75cb8dce69c94723ec13f9414fc50d7712a20574ea077674d359447edb709a14" ;
    ct:start_char 2428 .

ex:C027P0018 a ct:SourcePassage ;
    ct:end_char 3273 ;
    ct:exact_text "(c) Tadeo shall have the right (but not the obligation) to terminate this Agreement and the rights granted to Diplomat hereunder if:" ;
    ct:source_path "cuad/DYNTEKINC_07_30_1999-EX-10-ONLINE HOSTING AGREEMENT.txt" ;
    ct:source_sha256 "75cb8dce69c94723ec13f9414fc50d7712a20574ea077674d359447edb709a14" ;
    ct:start_char 3141 .

ex:C027P0025 a ct:SourcePassage ;
    ct:end_char 4750 ;
    ct:exact_text "(vi) Upon Tadeo giving Diplomat at least sixty (60) days advance written notice of termination of this Agreement." ;
    ct:source_path "cuad/DYNTEKINC_07_30_1999-EX-10-ONLINE HOSTING AGREEMENT.txt" ;
    ct:source_sha256 "75cb8dce69c94723ec13f9414fc50d7712a20574ea077674d359447edb709a14" ;
    ct:start_char 4637 .

ex:C027P0026 a ct:SourcePassage ;
    ct:end_char 4884 ;
    ct:exact_text "(d) Diplomat shall have the right (but not the obligation) to terminate this Agreement and the rights granted to Tadeo hereunder if:" ;
    ct:source_path "cuad/DYNTEKINC_07_30_1999-EX-10-ONLINE HOSTING AGREEMENT.txt" ;
    ct:source_sha256 "75cb8dce69c94723ec13f9414fc50d7712a20574ea077674d359447edb709a14" ;
    ct:start_char 4752 .

ex:C027P0037 a ct:SourcePassage ;
    ct:end_char 9336 ;
    ct:exact_text "(f) A party may exercise its right to terminate pursuant to this Section 3 by sending appropriate written notice to the other party. No exercise by a party of its rights under this Section will limit its remedies by reason of the other party's default, the party's rights to exercise any other rights under this Section 3, or any of that party's other rights." ;
    ct:source_path "cuad/DYNTEKINC_07_30_1999-EX-10-ONLINE HOSTING AGREEMENT.txt" ;
    ct:source_sha256 "75cb8dce69c94723ec13f9414fc50d7712a20574ea077674d359447edb709a14" ;
    ct:start_char 8977 .

ex:C027P0070 a ct:SourcePassage ;
    ct:end_char 20804 ;
    ct:exact_text "(f) The provisions of Sections 7, 8 and 9 hereof shall survive any termination of this Agreement." ;
    ct:source_path "cuad/DYNTEKINC_07_30_1999-EX-10-ONLINE HOSTING AGREEMENT.txt" ;
    ct:source_sha256 "75cb8dce69c94723ec13f9414fc50d7712a20574ea077674d359447edb709a14" ;
    ct:start_char 20707 .

